{"4790950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost ages Hunting", "steam_appid": 4790950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4851500], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Lost Ages Hunting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Ages Hunting is a first-person hunting simulation where each era offers a completely different hunting experience. Hunt prehistoric dinosaurs, Ice Age creatures, modern wildlife, and other unique species across vast open environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through vast open environments inspired by realistic European mountain landscapes and hunt deadly creatures from different ages of history and imagination. Track prey, survive hostile conditions, collect trophies, and build your reputation as a legendary hunter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in prehistoric wilderness filled with dangerous dinosaurs. Future updates will expand the world with new eras, including frozen Ice Age landscapes and post-apocalyptic mutant-infested regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large hunting areas featuring forests, rivers, mountains, abandoned zones, and dynamic environmental conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Hunt dangerous creatures across multiple eras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Large open-world environments inspired by realistic terrain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Dynamic day and night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Character progression and persistent save system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Multiple weapons and hunting equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Night vision hunting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Trophy collection and mounted creature displays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Rare creature variants with increased rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Expanding content during Early Access</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Curren